# Stoat's own web client, moved off the main domain (m3-plan.md task 7): concord.jaalip.com now leads to our
# client. Kept for voice until M4, and as the reference. It talks to the API on the main domain, which allows
# its origin. Mounted by concord.compose.yml; REF_DOMAIN is ref.<domain>.
{$REF_DOMAIN} {
	reverse_proxy http://web:5000
}
